# ush manifest — Uros shell #275.5.
#
# ush bootstraps its controlling tty via the "unbound-tty" exception
# in char_server (any caller can claim an unbound tty as ctty without
# a cap; once bound the session-owner check covers reads/writes via
# /dev/tty).  No caps required at v0.1.0.

name ush

# No `required` lines — empty caps_required.
# No `delegatable` lines — empty caps_delegatable.
